You have mastered every skill of your rank.
Few warriors come this far, and fewer still
go further. Elder Hosean watches over the
last test of strength before the fifth rank.

First, prove yourself in the field. I will set
you three hunts, one after another. For each,
slay forty of the creatures I name within the
time allowed, then come back to me. Each hunt
you report earns you a Moon Stone.

If time runs out, return and try again.
Stock up on potions before you agree.

[Quest Subject]

Three hunts of 40 monsters for your master.